    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Jon invests \\$7000 at 5% p.a. simple interest for 3 years. He then reinvests the whole balance at 4.8% p.a. simple interest for 18 months. Find his final balance.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$8629.60$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}I_1&=Prn=7000\\times0.05\\times3=1050\\\\A_1&=7000+1050=8050\\\\I_2&=8050\\times0.048\\times1.5=579.60\\\\A_2&=8050+579.60\\\\&=\\$8629.60\\end{align*}$$\n18 months is 1.5 years.",
